## Roadmap

Next up: (1) name an authorized target, (2) run `/start-investigation`, (3) keep Evidence IDs in the ledger, (4) reconstruct only what we are allowed to rebuild.

## Tone of voice

Technical, precise, calm. "Search resolves through module X; Evidence `abc` shows the import" not "it probably uses some search API." Error messages should help: "REA MCP is not connected — restart Cursor, then retry" not "something failed."

## Legal and compliance

REA is for lawful research, interoperability, preservation, and analysis of software you own or are authorized to examine. See `docs/AUTHORIZATION.md` and [REA's disclaimer](https://github.com/morluto/rea/blob/main/DISCLAIMER.md). Do not proceed without a stated authorization basis.
